entries[142367] = { ["name"] = "Ivory Feather", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Transform into an avenger of Aviana. PvP kills made while transformed have a chance to grant Marks of Prey. Only usable in Battlegrounds and Ashran. (1s cooldown) (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Talon's Vengeance\n- Honored\n\"The winds speak to Aviana from across all of Azeroth.\"\nSell Price:" }
